Date: Sat, 31 Oct 2026 15:11:20 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 16/16] Give the simulated-stream tests room on a busy machine

The assistant's answers and the editor's suggestions are simulated with timers; under four
parallel browsers in CI they can take several times longer than locally. The assistant tests wait
up to 30 s for the streamed text, the editor's axe test over four stories is marked slow, and
the editor story waits 1.5 s before its first word so "Stop before any text" isn't a race.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Te9bARZBkSfcxCSZLhK4ZW
